{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zcEB7bu1kp1793231629.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國石油首三季多賺近兩成二，純利有1,557億元人民幣。期內，收入2.3萬億元人民幣，按年上升百分之7。油氣和新能源收入佔近6,665億元人民幣，增長百分之6.5。</p><p></p><p>單計第三季純利逾518億元人民幣，按年增加逾兩成一。收入升一成，至7,935億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:43.287257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.603681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:58:50.086034+00:00","content_hash":"a8d83725d0300f16bbb504f4bb8325bdd4e48caea9ffa4c33d1aba312fedfe8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:43.287257+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}